{"version":1,"content":"<p>前TVB主持利穎怡於資訊節目勇於採訪而為人熟知，2024年離巢後以自由身任HOY TV節目《一線搜查》主持，繼續為民請命，近日她宣布再有新身份，原來獲邀到中文大學擔任客席講師，她透露：「成就解鎖，第一次做客席講師，感謝邀請。</p><p>」見她以一身斯文</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T12:12:00.786027+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T12:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T12:05:20.456844+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T12:05:20.456844+00:00","content_hash":"f9fd680cdcc1d75ba2e8b8c82d269593c5e49e30c03a7e511338b801347c48b4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}